{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022121109039-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022125043\"/><p>失平衡跌倒女子送院治理。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>紅磡發生扶手梯意外。今日(22日)早上11時33分，一名女子在港鐵黃埔站近民兆街出口使用扶手梯時懷疑失平衡跌倒，期間再撞跌在旁兩名人士。救護車接報到場將失平衡跌倒女子送院治理，另外兩名被撞跌人士經初步檢查後拒絕送院。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:01:07.048207+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:11:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T05:57:54.816516+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:57:49.012568+00:00","content_hash":"6403b70519ff41cbe1f3837714c12666d22525c824b1d8b752b3b38d44a2de08","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}